{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064132/block/singleImage/3269160/df/01M7K0QNZCPHTH3RD8AZ13ES8Q.jpg?updatedAt=1794880496\"/><figcaption>政府擬推「照顧家庭假」 公務員計鐘請假 每年最多12小時</figcaption></figure><p>政府計劃明年1月起為政府僱員推出「照顧家庭假」，每人每年可享最多12小時，以應付突發家庭需要。公務員事務局長楊何蓓茵昨在立法會一委員會上表示，相關情況未必能提供證明文件，因此毋須提交文件申請，希望為僱員提供更大便利及彈性。她指，新安排下公務員毋須再以半日假處理，可按小時計假照顧家庭事務，相信對人手影響不大，並期望政府起示範作用，帶動其他行業響應。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:26:41.580895+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:06:11.351834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T02:20:06.696381+00:00","content_hash":"cfe08faac30bbc2aa2c3dc72461ddf526374773ef779692525fd6504ad54af55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:26:41.580895+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}